---
---
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>404 Not Found - AUPB</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        color: #1e293b;
        font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 6rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin: 0;
        color: #0f172a;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        color: #64748b;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #0f172a;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }
      .btn:hover {
        background: #334155;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>404</h1>
      <p>お探しのページは見つかりませんでした。</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn">ホームに戻る</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
